abstract: >-
  Reference code and numerical evidence for applying SiLU to projected values
  before softmax-attention aggregation, with paired Transformer language-model
  experiments, completed GLU and tanh development comparisons, and fixed-checkpoint
  inference-time activation comparisons.
keywords:
  - Transformer
  - attention
  - language modeling
  - SiLU
  - value gating
